        <mxCell id="n12" value="The two phases the milestone plan calls parallel are parallel until their deployed ends, where each needs the other:&#10;the Room cannot show ego's own vehicle B without Phase 3's detector inside the image, and Phase 3's last three&#10;readings are taken off the log that Room produces. Group 4.12 additionally needs Phase 1's bench and radio node." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f9;strokeColor=#e3e5ea;fontColor=#3d3d46;fontSize=15.4;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="606" width="1120" height="74.69999999999999" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
